<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?><rss version="2.0" xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom"><channel><title>With-Gpt-5.2</title><link>https://jaehun.me/categories/with-gpt-5.2/</link><description>딥러닝 컴파일러 엔지니어 류재훈의 기술 블로그. LLM 추론 최적화, KV 캐시, 컴파일러, C++와 AI 논문·오픈소스 코드 분석을 정리합니다.</description><language>ko-kr</language><atom:link href="https://jaehun.me/categories/with-gpt-5.2/index.xml" rel="self" type="application/rss+xml"/><item><title>[논문리뷰]: Continuous Autoregressive Language Models</title><link>https://jaehun.me/posts/%EB%85%BC%EB%AC%B8%EB%A6%AC%EB%B7%B0-continuous-autoregressive-language-models/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://jaehun.me/posts/%EB%85%BC%EB%AC%B8%EB%A6%AC%EB%B7%B0-continuous-autoregressive-language-models/</guid><pubDate>Fri, 26 Dec 2025 00:00:00 +0900</pubDate><description>&lt;p&gt;&lt;a&#10; href="https://arxiv.org/abs/2510.27688v1"target="_blank"&#10; class="inline-flex items-center gap-1"&#10; &gt;논문 링크&lt;svg class="h-3 w-3 flex-shrink-0" id="external-link" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 24 24"&gt;&lt;path fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M15 3h6v6m-11 5L21 3m-3 10v6a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V8a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h6"/&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;&#10; &lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;h2 id="calm-토큰-by-토큰-병목을-연속-벡터-by-벡터로-우회하는-likelihood-free-언어모델링"&gt;CALM: 토큰-by-토큰 병목을 “연속 벡터-by-벡터”로 우회하는 Likelihood-Free 언어모델링&lt;a href="#calm-%ed%86%a0%ed%81%b0-by-%ed%86%a0%ed%81%b0-%eb%b3%91%eb%aa%a9%ec%9d%84-%ec%97%b0%ec%86%8d-%eb%b2%a1%ed%84%b0-by-%eb%b2%a1%ed%84%b0%eb%a1%9c-%ec%9a%b0%ed%9a%8c%ed%95%98%eb%8a%94-likelihood-free-%ec%96%b8%ec%96%b4%eb%aa%a8%eb%8d%b8%eb%a7%81" class="heading-anchor" aria-label="이 섹션에 대한 링크"&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;CALM&lt;/strong&gt; (Continuous Autoregressive Language Models) 은 (K=4) (tokens/step) 단위로 토큰을 연속 잠재벡터로 압축한 뒤 next-vector를 AR로 생성해, &lt;strong&gt;유사한 품질(BrierLM)&lt;/strong&gt; 근처에서 학습 FLOPs와 추론 FLOPs/token을 동시에 낮추는 “성능–컴퓨트 프런티어 이동”을 주장한다. (근거: §7.2, Tab.1)&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>[논문리뷰]: Memory Retrieval and Consolidation in Large Language Models through Function Tokens</title><link>https://jaehun.me/posts/%EB%85%BC%EB%AC%B8%EB%A6%AC%EB%B7%B0-memory-retrieval-and-consolidation-in-large-language-models-through-function-tokens/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://jaehun.me/posts/%EB%85%BC%EB%AC%B8%EB%A6%AC%EB%B7%B0-memory-retrieval-and-consolidation-in-large-language-models-through-function-tokens/</guid><pubDate>Sat, 20 Dec 2025 00:00:00 +0900</pubDate><description>&lt;p&gt;&lt;a&#10; href="https://arxiv.org/abs/2510.08203v1"target="_blank"&#10; class="inline-flex items-center gap-1"&#10; &gt;논문 링크&lt;svg class="h-3 w-3 flex-shrink-0" id="external-link" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 24 24"&gt;&lt;path fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M15 3h6v6m-11 5L21 3m-3 10v6a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V8a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h6"/&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;&#10; &lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;h2 id="function-token-hypothesis-llm-기억-검색의-게이트는-왜-구두점과-개행인가"&gt;Function Token Hypothesis: LLM “기억 검색”의 게이트는 왜 구두점과 개행인가&lt;a href="#function-token-hypothesis-llm-%ea%b8%b0%ec%96%b5-%ea%b2%80%ec%83%89%ec%9d%98-%ea%b2%8c%ec%9d%b4%ed%8a%b8%eb%8a%94-%ec%99%9c-%ea%b5%ac%eb%91%90%ec%a0%90%ea%b3%bc-%ea%b0%9c%ed%96%89%ec%9d%b8%ea%b0%80" class="heading-anchor" aria-label="이 섹션에 대한 링크"&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;h2 id="한-줄-요약-tldr"&gt;한 줄 요약 (TL;DR)&lt;a href="#%ed%95%9c-%ec%a4%84-%ec%9a%94%ec%95%bd-tldr" class="heading-anchor" aria-label="이 섹션에 대한 링크"&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;이 논문은 LLM의 기억을 “feature의 재활성화(retrieval) + 학습을 통한 feature 확장(consolidation)”으로 정의하고, &lt;strong&gt;function token&lt;/strong&gt;(고빈도 토큰)이 추론 시점에 예측에 필요한 feature들을 문맥-조건부로 재점화하며, 사전학습에서는&lt;strong&gt;function→content&lt;/strong&gt;예측이 최적화를 지배해 feature 수를 키운다는&lt;strong&gt;Function Token Hypothesis&lt;/strong&gt; 를 정량(coverage/degree)·정성(reactivation trace)·인과(steering)·학습동학(loss decomposition)으로 엮어 제시한다. (근거: §1, Fig.1, §3.1, Tab.1, §3.2, Fig.6, Fig.7, §4.2, Fig.8, §4.3, Fig.9)&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>[논문리뷰]: NVIDIA Nemotron 3: Efficient and Open Intelligence</title><link>https://jaehun.me/posts/%EB%85%BC%EB%AC%B8%EB%A6%AC%EB%B7%B0-nvidia-nemotron-3-efficient-and-open-intelligence/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://jaehun.me/posts/%EB%85%BC%EB%AC%B8%EB%A6%AC%EB%B7%B0-nvidia-nemotron-3-efficient-and-open-intelligence/</guid><pubDate>Tue, 16 Dec 2025 00:00:00 +0900</pubDate><description>&lt;p&gt;&lt;a&#10; href="https://research.nvidia.com/labs/nemotron/files/NVIDIA-Nemotron-3-White-Paper.pdf"target="_blank"&#10; class="inline-flex items-center gap-1"&#10; &gt;논문 링크&lt;svg class="h-3 w-3 flex-shrink-0" id="external-link" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 24 24"&gt;&lt;path fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M15 3h6v6m-11 5L21 3m-3 10v6a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V8a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h6"/&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;&#10; &lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;h2 id="nvidia-nemotron-3-하이브리드-mambatransformer-moe로-정확도처리량-프런티어를-당기다"&gt;NVIDIA Nemotron 3: 하이브리드 Mamba–Transformer MoE로 “정확도/처리량” 프런티어를 당기다&lt;a href="#nvidia-nemotron-3-%ed%95%98%ec%9d%b4%eb%b8%8c%eb%a6%ac%eb%93%9c-mambatransformer-moe%eb%a1%9c-%ec%a0%95%ed%99%95%eb%8f%84%ec%b2%98%eb%a6%ac%eb%9f%89-%ed%94%84%eb%9f%b0%ed%8b%b0%ec%96%b4%eb%a5%bc-%eb%8b%b9%ea%b8%b0%eb%8b%a4" class="heading-anchor" aria-label="이 섹션에 대한 링크"&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Nemotron 3&lt;/strong&gt; 는 MoE 하이브리드 Mamba–Transformer, &lt;strong&gt;LatentMoE&lt;/strong&gt; , &lt;strong&gt;MTP&lt;/strong&gt; , &lt;strong&gt;NVFP4&lt;/strong&gt; 학습, &lt;strong&gt;멀티-환경 RL&lt;/strong&gt; 을 결합해 “정확도 대비 추론 처리량(accuracy-to-inference-throughput)”을 끌어올리고, &lt;strong&gt;최대 1M tokens 컨텍스트&lt;/strong&gt; 와 &lt;strong&gt;상대 처리량 3.3×&lt;/strong&gt; 를 핵심 메시지로 제시한다 (근거: §Intro/§2.2/§2.3/§2.4/§2.5/§2.6/Fig.2).&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>[논문리뷰]: Radial Attention: O(n log n) Sparse Attention with Energy Decay for Long Video Generation</title><link>https://jaehun.me/posts/%EB%85%BC%EB%AC%B8%EB%A6%AC%EB%B7%B0-radial-attention-on-log-n-sparse-attention-with-energy-decay-for-long-video-generation/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://jaehun.me/posts/%EB%85%BC%EB%AC%B8%EB%A6%AC%EB%B7%B0-radial-attention-on-log-n-sparse-attention-with-energy-decay-for-long-video-generation/</guid><pubDate>Mon, 15 Dec 2025 00:00:00 +0900</pubDate><description>&lt;p&gt;&lt;a&#10; href="https://arxiv.org/abs/2506.19852v1"target="_blank"&#10; class="inline-flex items-center gap-1"&#10; &gt;논문 링크&lt;svg class="h-3 w-3 flex-shrink-0" id="external-link" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 24 24"&gt;&lt;path fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M15 3h6v6m-11 5L21 3m-3 10v6a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V8a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h6"/&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;&#10; &lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;h2 id="radial-attention-on-log-n-sparse-attention-with-energy-decay로-긴-비디오를-싸게-뽑기"&gt;Radial Attention: O(n log n) Sparse Attention with Energy Decay로 “긴 비디오”를 싸게 뽑기&lt;a href="#radial-attention-on-log-n-sparse-attention-with-energy-decay%eb%a1%9c-%ea%b8%b4-%eb%b9%84%eb%94%94%ec%98%a4%eb%a5%bc-%ec%8b%b8%ea%b2%8c-%eb%bd%91%ea%b8%b0" class="heading-anchor" aria-label="이 섹션에 대한 링크"&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;h2 id="한-줄-요약-tldr"&gt;한 줄 요약 (TL;DR)&lt;a href="#%ed%95%9c-%ec%a4%84-%ec%9a%94%ec%95%bd-tldr" class="heading-anchor" aria-label="이 섹션에 대한 링크"&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;사후(softmax 이후) attention 에너지가 거리(시간/공간)와 함께 &lt;strong&gt;지수적으로 감쇠&lt;/strong&gt; 한다는 관찰을 바탕으로, 계산 밀도도 같은 방식으로 감쇠시키는 &lt;strong&gt;정적(static) 마스크&lt;/strong&gt;를 설계해 긴 비디오 생성의 훈련/추론 비용을 크게 줄인다. (근거: §4.1–§4.2, Eq.3–Eq.4)&lt;/p&gt;</description></item></channel></rss>